    <Placemark>
      <name>Samos (Eupalinos Tunnel) (מנהרת אופלינוס (סמוס))</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Samos (Eupalinos Tunnel) (מנהרת אופלינוס (סמוס))</h3>
<p><b>Period:</b> 10. Classical &amp; Later Periods (-586 to +638 CE)</p>
<p><b>Installation Type:</b> Water Tunnel Shaft</p>
<p><b>Location Precision:</b> Tier 4: International Comparative Site (&lt; 100m - 1km)</p>
<p><b>Region:</b> Greece</p>
<p><b>Dissertation Reference:</b> §3.7 (Pages 212)</p>
<hr/>
<p><b>Archaeological Description (10. Classical &amp; Later Periods):</b></p>
<p>The Eupalinos Tunnel, a 2 km long tunnel with 60 shafts, built in 524 BCE.</p>]]></description>
